{"message": "Fixed the build and runtime defects for the `bq27z746` fuel gauge driver and test suite on `native_sim`:

1. **`drivers/fuel_gauge/bq27z746/Kconfig`**: Changed `EMUL_BQ27Z746` dependency from `depends on !EMUL` to `depends on EMUL` so the emulator is enabled when `CONFIG_EMUL=y`.
2. **`tests/drivers/fuel_gauge/bq27z746/boards/native_sim.overlay`**: Added the missing `compatible = "ti,bq27z746";` property to the `bq27z746@55` devicetree node so the driver and emulator are instantiated for `i2c0`.", "kind": "FinishAction"}

